### 1. Listar reportes próximos à Av. Paulista (Público)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/nearby?lat=-23.5505&lng=-46.6333&radius=5000

### 2. Criar um novo reporte (Requer Token)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/reports
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "obstacle_type": "steep_slope",
  "severity": 4,
  "description": "Rua com inclinação muito forte, impossível para cadeira de rodas manual.",
  "lat": -23.5510,
  "lng": -46.6345
}

### 3. Confirmar um reporte (Troque o "1" pelo ID de um reporte retornado no teste 1)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/reports/1/verify
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "confirmed": true
}

### Login com o João
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@example.com",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### 4. Calcular Score de Rota (Simulando um trajeto perto da Paulista)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/routes/score
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waypoints": [
    [-23.5505, -46.6333],
    [-23.5510, -46.6345],
    [-23.5520, -46.6350]
  ],
  "mobility_profile": "wheelchair"
}

### 5. Buscar Estatísticas Gerais
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stats